    },
    "Un groupe cherche un remplaçant près de toi ? Tu reçois l'alerte 30 min avant tout le monde — le cachet est pour toi.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine Band in deiner Nähe sucht Ersatz? Du bekommst den Alert 30 Min. vor allen anderen — die Gage gehört dir."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A band near you needs a sub? You get the alert 30 min before everyone else — the fee is yours."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "¿Una banda cerca busca reemplazo? Recibes la alerta 30 min antes que nadie — el caché es tuyo."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una band vicino a te cerca un sostituto? Ricevi l'avviso 30 min prima di tutti — il compenso è tuo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "近くのバンドが代役募集？誰よりも30分早く通知が届き、ギャラはあなたのものに。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "附近有乐队找替补？你比所有人提前30分钟收到提醒——酬劳就是你的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Un membre lâche ? Publier un SOS": {
      "localizations": {
